{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And your southern region shall be from the wilderness of Zin along the side of Edom.</b> 'Along the side of' (על ידי) means 'beside,' as in (Numbers 34:13) ״ועל יד הירדן״ — 'along the side of the Jordan,' which means beside the Jordan. Here then He explains to them the border of their inheritance, which they are obligated to conquer from the enemies there. And Rashi, of blessed memory, wrote: many commandments apply in the Land that do not apply outside the Land; therefore he needed to explain to us the borders of the directions all around, to make known that from these borders and inward the commandments apply — end of quotation."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:37:48.446519013Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}